{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-07-01 11:17:00', 'title': 'PNC DECLARES DIVIDEND OF $1.50 ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH , JULY 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK OF $1.50 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE AUG. 5, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS JULY 13, 2022.'}